{"version":1,"content":"<p>2022 年 6 月，一名23歲瑜伽導師被警方發現倒斃在尖沙嘴麗思卡爾頓酒店房內浴缸，其臉部、頸部、胸部及四肢有逾30處刀傷。</p><p>死者前男友被控一項謀殺罪，案件今日在高等法院開審。</p><p>控方開案陳辭指，被告入住酒店前，曾到上海街廚具店購買刀具，其後與死者一同進入房間。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:16.462180+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:25:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:38:53.237300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.820198+00:00","content_hash":"59e738f653accb37b8d8a3dab110a3f8e73426468d3d2282c4f9ac93b64cc5d8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}